[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the tailgate.</p><p>1. Release the retaining buttons using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.015.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the protection.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005107.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Bose radio amplifier</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024659\">P70</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>3. Remove the amplifier</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005108.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the amplifier  is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Position the amplifier and fix it using\nthe bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><p>Position the protection and fix it with\nthe retaining studs.</p><p>Test the radio  to ensure it is working\nproperly.</p>"]]